SCOPE AND THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

This licence covers the curated dataset and documentation authored by this
project. It does NOT re-license the underlying sources, which retain their own
terms. Redistribution status is tracked PER ROW in the `redistribution` column of
data/measurements.csv:

  public_domain          US patent material; values may be reproduced freely.
  summary_stat           Derived summary statistics from copyrighted publications.
  derived_features_only  Only derived features may be redistributed, not raw values.
  verify                 Licence not yet confirmed; resolve before release.

Source PDFs under toxicity/*/sources/ and toxicity/_shared/reference/ are
third-party works included for verification only and are NOT covered by this
licence. They retain their publishers' terms.
